+ * Source DEVICEDAT.MAR 129-254, 354-475; SYSDEF.MDL DDB/UCB layouts.
+ * DDT/CRB/DEVCHAR/device-class fields that require absent driver code or
+ * unverified STARLET constants are kept zero. No I/O or IOC publication. */
